/T (FTK Imager FTK Imager is one of the most commonly used acquisition tools in forensic investigations. It creates exact disk images in a forensically sound manner, supports different formats, and captures the data without altering the original media. It also provides capabilities for previewing files, carving deleted data, and generating hashes for verifying integrity.)
