/T (In some cases, evidence data needs to be acquired from live systems instead of, or in addition to, disk images. Live triage tools enable the quick collection of artifacts from systems that are still running. These tools allow analysts to prioritize and triage key evidence to gain immediate insights into suspicious activity while a full disk image is being created. )
